 ],
 "synopsis": "The Competition Commission of India has approved GRT Jewellers (India) Private Limited's proposed acquisition of a 74.12% stake in Tribhovandas Bhimji Zaveri Limited from its promoters for a consideration of up to 1,033.71 crore rupees. Under a share purchase agreement announced on August 31, GRT Jewellers is set to acquire 4,94,59,775 equity shares. GRT has also proposed an open offer to acquire an additional stake of around 26% in TBZ under SEBI regulations. The approval clears a key regulatory hurdle, though the transaction is not yet complete and remains subject to applicable closing conditions.",
